Spire Growth is a normal [[Monsters|Enemy]] found exclusively in [[Act 3]].

== Pattern ==
{{Intents|Spire Growth}}
Each turn, it has a 50/50 chance to use either {{Int|Spire Growth|Quick Tackle}} or {{Int|Spire Growth|Constrict}}.

If {{Int|Spire Growth|Constrict}} was used last turn or the player already has {{KW|Constricted}}, it uses {{Int|Spire Growth|Smash}} instead.

Cannot use either attack three times in a row.

== Found With ==
=== Act 3 ===
* Solo

